From 9fb295eb3ae7980dcac01354a1bbabe1d4d4a0e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Gonzalez Martin <sergiog@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:46:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [rust jpeg] Backport AVX2 IDCT and scan-resume improvements
 (PR526)

Backport https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image/pull/526 at published
head b5ad1d9cffac891868e9c86b6fe1aa0a56afbcc9, after PR525.

Keep the Chromium stack native recovery and i32 coefficient support
while reducing repeated header-table clones and coefficient clears.
Preserve the wide-coefficient range guards and 32-bit fallback paths.
Adapt marker-state tests to the existing equivalent insufficient-data
state. Scan-resume tests cover configured options; no-SIMD feature
builds provide scalar execution without changing zune-core.

Bug: 584016785
Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
